{"id":"8184bbc4f58748b7","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-lem-interpolation-prop.md","title":"Interpolation Property","display":"lem-interpolation-prop — Interpolation Property","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-interpolation-prop","aliases":["58-lem-interpolation-prop"],"display":"lem-interpolation-prop — Interpolation Property","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-interpolation-prop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-interpolation-prop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-interpolation-prop — Interpolation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e83a214f93c9681\" href=\"?note=8e83a214f93c9681\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (a first-order language whose only nonlogical symbols are nullary relation symbols, coding propositional variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (language predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst},\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst},\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (signature components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (registered Craig-interpolation property)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}prop}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst}=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=\\varnothing=\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\n\\right]\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}prop}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst}=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=\\varnothing=\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\n\\right]\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is Craig interpolation for classical propositional logic.</li>\n<li>Lyndon interpolation additionally controls the polarity of shared variables.</li>\n<li>Propositional variables are represented by nullary relation symbols, so the conclusion reuses the registered sentence/vocabulary/consequence semantics instead of introducing unsourced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{prop}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> primitives.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property.md","status":"resolved","id":"8e83a214f93c9681","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst},\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}prop}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst}=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=\\varnothing=\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\n\\right]\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{prop}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false}],"bytes":1522,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3907","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-lem-interpolation-prop.md|58-lem-interpolation-prop]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["8e83a214f93c9681","3888033a846b1cd5"]}